title: "2030"
permalink: /2030/
---
<p class="standfirst">
  Fiction. One instalment a week, every Friday, about somebody living in
  2030 inside the arrangements this site argues about: who owns the
  assistant, who can refuse, who got the extra day, who holds the memory.
  The people and places are invented; the machine writes it and the story
  carries on from week to week. Collected here in order, so it reads as one
  story.
</p>

{%- if collections.serial.length %}
{%- for part in collections.serial %}
<article class="instalment">
  <p class="eyebrow">Instalment {{ loop.index }} · {{ part.date | readable }}</p>
  <h2><a href="{{ part.url | url }}">{{ part.data.title }}</a></h2>
  {{ part.templateContent | safe }}
</article>
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
<p>The first instalment is due on the first Friday. Nothing has been written yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
